WEBVTT

00:27:26.663 --> 00:27:33.079
narcissistic in terms of how they pay
themselves versus how their top leaders

00:27:33.079 --> 00:27:34.163
within their company are paid.

00:27:34.454 --> 00:27:36.246
Those who come of age in recessions

00:27:36.246 --> 00:27:39.204
and then become leaders of organizations
are less entitled

00:27:41.121 --> 00:27:42.538
knowing what it's like to struggle.

00:27:42.829 --> 00:27:46.913
These CEOs seem to care more for employees
and behave less selfishly.

00:27:47.579 --> 00:27:50.163
They become proactive about
taking responsibility.

00:27:50.663 --> 00:27:53.954
In one study, Emily discovered that
CEOs who launched their careers in

00:27:53.954 --> 00:27:57.996
a recession were less likely to backdate
their stock options to maximize their

00:27:57.996 --> 00:28:01.538
value. In other words, they
were less likely to cheat,